### 1. Create a new record (POST)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Testing the backend API",
  "category": "Book search",
  "description": "This is a test record created from the API client.",
  "status": "Pending"
}

### 2. Get the record you just created (Replace 15 with your actual new ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/records/15    

### 3. Update the record (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/records/15
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Backend API Test",
  "category": "Account help",
  "description": "I changed the status and category to test the PUT route.",
  "status": "Completed"
}

### 4. Delete the record (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/records/15

### 5. Try to get the deleted record (Should be 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/records/15